{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"72ba93f87e7f074bd229730e3ba3bc7c90d1e132309adbe9757902583cebe833"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:7ca25f5cc2cb49d03d7cde023f3b1ddc9eaaab978ef919c2056a44a5e774f2fa","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"In early August 2023","evidence":"[D29:2 | 8:06 pm on 9 August, 2023] John: Hey Maria! Congrats on the recognition! It's really touching to see how much you're doing to help out. Last weekend, I participated in a community event to raise money for a good cause. We got a great turnout and it was amazing to be surrounded by so many supportive people.\n[D29:4 | 8:06 pm on 9 August, 2023] John: I set up a 5K charity run in our neighborhood. It was all for a good cause - to help out veterans and their families. We were able to raise some funds! Here's a pic from the day.","itemId":"urn:uuid:e2d8e182-bff1-5d4e-aab9-6ef73797c0e5","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:37c10324bf98efe8b896c4512a1143f1ff2e9763f04c9e12719e40eb57e49ed5","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did John participate in a 5K charity run?","referenceAnswer":"first weekend of August 2023","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"37c10324bf98efe8b896c4512a1143f1ff2e9763f04c9e12719e40eb57e49ed5"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}